  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.53,
      "end": 4.55,
      "text": "Alrighty, so here's this clip from this week and you can see Diego's off to a good start, you know"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 8.71,
      "text": "Oh and nope, he is not. Leo, this guy just bought a new Aeroad"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.71,
      "end": 14.99,
      "text": "with Dura-Ace and so he's putting it to the test or something. I guess he's been saving this fucking ripping"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.57,
      "end": 21.07,
      "text": "Poor Diego. I'm like, okay, do I do I attack? I got a little bit of gas. I'm pretty tired"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.07,
      "end": 23.01,
      "text": "You know, we had some good attacks earlier in the ride"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.67,
      "end": 25.61,
      "text": "smashed through that hole and"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.61,
      "end": 29.83,
      "text": "Kind of coast in down we hit the bottom of the hill here and I'm off to the right"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.83,
      "end": 36.51,
      "text": "I'm just gonna set it up the hill and we do indeed kind of gap Diego a little bit here on the left. Sorry Diego"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.77,
      "end": 41.77,
      "text": "Trying to get that KOM as much as I can and then we come up here and"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.57,
      "end": 47.47,
      "text": "He definitely beat us to the top of the hill, but apparently not enough. Here is the KOM"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.47,
      "end": 52.81,
      "text": "I got very sorry Diego, but we'll have to race it up again on the next Saturday"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.58,
      "end": 60.78,
      "text": "But here's the KOM that I got. Sorry Diego. We'll have to race up the segment one more time next Saturday"
    }
  ],
